stages.sampleAnswer:
- User: { userId, phoneNumber, status (online/offline/away), lastSeenAt }
- Chat: { chatId, type (1:1 or group), members: [userId] }
- Message: { messageId, chatId, senderId, text, sentTimestamp, sequenceNumber }
- MessageReceipt: { messageId, recipientId, deliveredAt?, readAt? }

POST /chats/{chatId}/messages
  body: { text, clientMessageId (idempotency) }
  → 201 { messageId, sentAt, status: 'sent' }

GET /chats/{chatId}/messages?cursor=... → { messages: [...], nextCursor }

WS /chats/{chatId}/stream → server pushes { messageId, senderId, text, sentAt } to all online members

POST /messages/{messageId}/read → 200 { readAt }

GET /chats → list of recent chats with unread counts
GET /users/{userId}/presence → { status, lastSeenAt }
